  "text": "### Data Breach Response  \n**Notification Requirement (GDPR):**\n- If breach likely to cause high risk to individuals\n- Notify individuals within 72 hours\n- Notification includes: What happened, what data, mitigation steps, contact for questions  \n**Internal Notification:**\n- Breach identified → Escalate to Data Protection Officer\n- Investigation within 24 hours\n- Assessment of risk level\n- Notification decision\n- Regulatory notification (if required to ICO)  \n---",
